        <li>Keys to all doors (adequate copies)</li>
        <li>Two garage door openers when applicable</li>
        <li>Locks re-keyed between occupants for safety and liability protection</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ReviewsCarousel />

  {/* Replaces the mockup's old placeholder 6-step form (same stale
      pre-real-tool pattern as the homepage's — see that page's own
