        <div class="section-kicker">Free Rental Analysis</div>
        <h2>What Could Your Indianapolis Rental Earn?</h2>
        <p class="lead">Get a professional rental analysis backed by local market activity, comparable homes, current competition, and Red Door's experience managing rentals in Indianapolis and across Central Indiana.</p>
        <ul class="benefit-list">
          <li><span>1</span>Understand your property's current rental value.</li>
